#: ../../source/api-reference/sqd.rst:2
msgid "SQD API"
msgstr "SQD API"

#: ../../source/api-reference/sqd.rst:4
msgid ""
"The SQD API is optional. Install it with ``uv sync --frozen --extra sqd``. Configuration and "
"result contracts remain importable without the optional sampling backend. Workflow functions load"
" on access when the environment contains ``ffsim`` and ``qiskit-addon-sqd``."
msgstr ""
"SQD API 为可选项。使用 ``uv sync --frozen --extra sqd`` 安装。配置与结果类型无需可选采样后端即可导入。环境包含 ``ffsim`` 和 "
"``qiskit-addon-sqd`` 时，工作流函数在访问时加载。"

#: ../../source/api-reference/sqd.rst:10
msgid "Public Workflows"
msgstr "公共工作流"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd:1
msgid "Run SQD from geometry in Angstrom with an explicit closed-shell active space."
msgstr "从以埃为单位的几何结构运行 SQD，并显式指定闭壳层活性空间。"

#: ../../source/api-reference/sqd.rst of q2m3.sqd.config.CCSDSeed q2m3.sqd.config.IntegralContext
