msgstr "参数"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd:3
msgid "Atomic element symbols."
msgstr "原子元素符号。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd:4
msgid "Atomic coordinates in Angstrom."
msgstr "原子坐标，单位为埃。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd:5
msgid "Even active electron count."
msgstr "偶数个活性电子。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.ansatz.build_ccsd_seed_from_integrals:10 q2m3.sqd.integrals.hamiltonian_id:11
#: q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd:6 q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd_from_integrals:6
msgid "Active spatial orbital count."
msgstr "活性空间轨道数。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd:7
msgid "Molecular charge."
msgstr "分子电荷。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd:8
msgid "PySCF basis name."
msgstr "PySCF 基组名称。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd:9 q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd_from_integrals:10
msgid "Ansatz and sampling configuration."
msgstr "拟设与采样配置。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd:10
msgid "Baseline policy and shared run resource budgets."
msgstr "基线策略和运行共享的资源预算。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd:11
msgid "Optional point charges in atomic charge units."
msgstr "可选的点电荷，以原子电荷单位表示。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd:12
msgid "Point-charge positions in Angstrom."
msgstr "点电荷位置，单位为埃。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd:13
msgid "Fixed-frame one-electron embedding treatment."
msgstr "固定参考系中的单电子嵌入处理。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd:14
msgid "Nonnegative seed forwarded to all stochastic operations."
msgstr "传递给所有随机操作的非负随机种子。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd:15
msgid ""
"Forward soft-policy override where supported. Existing component/model caps remain in force, "
"including 8192 MB."
msgstr "在支持的位置传递软策略覆盖设置。现有组件/模型上限仍然有效，包括 8192 MB。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd:17
msgid "Print a compact energy/status summary."
msgstr "打印简明的能量/状态摘要。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd:18
msgid "Full SQD or explicitly requested reference-only calculation."
msgstr "完整 SQD 计算或显式请求的仅参考计算。"

#: ../../source/api-reference/sqd.rst of q2m3.sqd.integrals.build_integrals
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "返回值"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd:20
msgid "Validated immutable energies, metadata and resource/timing audit."
msgstr "已验证的不可变能量、元数据和资源/计时审计记录。"

#: ../../source/api-reference/sqd.rst of q2m3.sqd.integrals.build_integrals
msgid "Raises"
msgstr "异常"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd:22
msgid "Inputs or execution environment are unsupported."
msgstr "不支持输入或执行环境。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd:23
msgid "Allocation or observed process RSS reaches a cap."
msgstr "内存分配量或观测到的进程 RSS 达到上限。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd:24 q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd_from_integrals:20
