msgstr "共享的总执行时限到期。"

#: ../../source/api-reference/sqd.rst of q2m3.sqd.config.LUCJConfig.validate
#: q2m3.sqd.config.ReferenceConfig.validate q2m3.sqd.config.SQDConfig.validate
#: q2m3.sqd.integrals.build_integrals q2m3.sqd.result.ReferenceAttempt.validate
#: q2m3.sqd.result.ReferenceResult.validate q2m3.sqd.result.T1Residual.validate
#: q2m3.sqd.result.T2Diagnostics.validate
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "返回类型"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd_from_integrals:1
msgid "Run the same workflow from real chemist integrals and authenticated provenance."
msgstr "从实数化学家记号积分和已验证的来源记录运行同一工作流。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd_from_integrals:3
msgid "Real one-electron integrals in Hartree."
msgstr "实数单电子积分，单位为 Hartree。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd_from_integrals:4
msgid "Real chemist two-electron tensor, without any additional transposition."
msgstr "化学家记号的实数双电子张量，不再进行任何额外转置。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd_from_integrals:5
msgid "Core constant in Hartree, already including embedding corrections."
msgstr "核心常数，单位为 Hartree，已包含嵌入修正。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd_from_integrals:7
msgid "Balanced alpha/beta electron counts."
msgstr "相等的 alpha/beta 电子数。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd_from_integrals:8
msgid "Integral/frame identifiers and constant decomposition."
msgstr "积分/参考系标识符及常数分解。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd_from_integrals:9
msgid "Same-frame CCSD seed. Use None only in reference-only mode."
msgstr "同一参考系中的 CCSD 初始解。仅在仅参考模式下使用 None。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd_from_integrals:11
msgid "Baseline policy and total shared resource budgets."
msgstr "基线策略和共享的总资源预算。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd_from_integrals:12
msgid "Nonnegative run seed."
msgstr "非负的运行随机种子。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd_from_integrals:13
msgid "Forward supported overrides within existing component caps."
msgstr "在现有组件上限内传递受支持的覆盖设置。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd_from_integrals:14
msgid "Full SQD or explicit reference-only calculation."
msgstr "完整 SQD 计算或显式指定的仅参考计算。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd_from_integrals:16
msgid "Validated immutable result, using exactly one copy of e_core in energies."
msgstr "已验证的不可变结果，能量中恰好计入一次 e_core。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd_from_integrals:18
msgid "The declared integral contract is invalid."
msgstr "所声明的积分契约无效。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.orchestrator.run_sqd_from_integrals:19
msgid "Predicted or actual resources exceed the budget."
msgstr "预测或实际资源用量超出预算。"

#: ../../source/api-reference/sqd.rst:17
msgid "Configuration Contracts"
msgstr "配置契约"

#: of q2m3.sqd.config.LUCJConfig:1
msgid "Spin-balanced ansatz and sampling configuration."
msgstr "自旋平衡的拟设与采样配置。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.config.LUCJConfig.validate:1
msgid "Validate counts and connectivity structure, returning this instance."
msgstr "验证数量和连接结构，并返回此实例。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.config.ReferenceConfig:1
msgid "Reference solver budgets, allowed tiers, and ordered optional plugins."
msgstr "参考求解器预算、允许的层级和有序的可选插件。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.config.ReferenceConfig.validate:1
msgid "Validate finite budgets and strictly descending cutoffs. Return self."
msgstr "验证预算为有限值且截断值严格递减。返回自身。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.config.SQDConfig:1
msgid "SQD run configuration. The molecule retains its existing mutable semantics."
msgstr "SQD 运行配置。分子保留现有的可变语义。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.config.SQDConfig.validate:1
msgid "Validate molecular and run inputs, returning this instance."
msgstr "验证分子和运行输入，并返回此实例。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.config.SQDConfig.snapshot:1
msgid "Capture an independent immutable configuration at the time of the call."
msgstr "在调用时获取独立的不可变配置快照。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.config.SQDConfig.snapshot:3
msgid "A recursively frozen mapping suitable for runtime provenance."
msgstr "适用于运行时来源记录的递归冻结映射。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.config.SQDConfig.snapshot:5
msgid "Configuration contains nonfinite or non-JSON metadata."
msgstr "配置包含非有限值或非 JSON 元数据。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.config.IntegralContext:1
msgid "Immutable metadata describing the supplied fixed orbital Hamiltonian."
msgstr "描述所提供的固定轨道哈密顿量的不可变元数据。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.config.CCSDSeed:1
msgid "Copied read-only RCCSD amplitudes and declared solver provenance."
msgstr "已复制的只读 RCCSD 振幅及所声明的求解器来源记录。"

#: ../../source/api-reference/sqd.rst:35
msgid "Result Contracts"
msgstr "结果契约"

#: ../../source/api-reference/sqd.rst:37
msgid "See :doc:`sqd-results` for field units and absence rules."
msgstr "字段单位与缺失值规则见 :doc:`sqd-results`。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.result.SQDResult:1
msgid "Complete SQD report, with absent work represented by None and a reason."
msgstr "完整的 SQD 报告；未执行的工作以 None 和原因表示。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.result.SQDResult.validate:1
msgid "Validate finite data, reference semantics and execution consistency."
msgstr "验证数据为有限值、参考结果语义以及执行一致性。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.result.SQDResult.validate:3
msgid "This immutable result."
msgstr "此不可变结果。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.result.SQDResult.validate:5
msgid "A field contradicts the result schema or executed mode."
msgstr "某字段与结果模式或已执行模式冲突。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.result.ReferenceResult:1
msgid "A reference energy with explicit uncertainty and execution provenance."
msgstr "包含明确不确定性和执行来源记录的参考能量。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.result.ReferenceResult.validate:1
msgid "Validate reference metadata and diagnostics, returning this record."
msgstr "验证参考元数据和诊断信息，并返回此记录。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.result.ReferenceAttempt:1
msgid "One auditable reference selection or execution outcome."
msgstr "一项可审计的参考选择或执行结果。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.result.ReferenceAttempt.validate:1
msgid "Validate the outcome and decimal-MB measurement, returning this record."
msgstr "验证结果和以十进制 MB 计量的数值，并返回此记录。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.result.T1Residual:1
msgid "Adjacent-cutoff residual, attributed to the looser executed point."
msgstr "相邻截断值之间的残差，归于已执行的较宽松截断点。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.result.T1Residual.validate:1
msgid "Check cutoff ordering and the residual, returning this record."
msgstr "检查截断值顺序和残差，并返回此记录。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.result.T2Diagnostics:1
msgid "Independent coupled-cluster reliability flags for a T2 baseline."
msgstr "T2 基线的独立耦合簇可靠性标志。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.result.T2Diagnostics.validate:1
msgid "Check each flag against its own diagnostic, returning this record."
msgstr "逐一根据对应诊断检查各标志，并返回此记录。"

#: ../../source/api-reference/sqd.rst:55
msgid "Authenticated Integral Assembly"
msgstr "经来源验证的积分构建"

#: ../../source/api-reference/sqd.rst:57
msgid ""
"These lower-level producers create the provenance records required by ``run_sqd_from_integrals``."
" The integral tensor uses real chemist ordering. The solver adds ``e_core`` exactly once."
msgstr "这些底层函数生成 ``run_sqd_from_integrals`` 所需的来源记录。积分张量使用实数化学家顺序。求解器只加一次 ``e_core``。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.integrals.IntegralData:1
msgid "Immutable chemist Hamiltonian, complete MO snapshot and its provenance."
msgstr "不可变的化学家记号哈密顿量、完整 MO 快照及其来源记录。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.integrals.IntegralData:3
msgid ""
"``hf_energy`` is the expectation of the first ``nelec[0]`` active orbitals, including e_core. It "
"is not a relaxed-MM SCF minimum. No CCSD amplitudes are constructed here. Downstream seed solvers"
" must consume this same Hamiltonian."
msgstr ""
"``hf_energy`` 是前 ``nelec[0]`` 个活性轨道的期望值，包含 e_core。它不是经 MM 松弛的 SCF 极小值。此处不构建 CCSD "
"振幅。下游初始解求解器必须使用同一个哈密顿量。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.integrals.build_integrals:1
msgid "Build a guarded molecular Hamiltonian in its one vacuum RHF frame."
msgstr "在分子唯一的真空 RHF 参考系中构建带保护检查的哈密顿量。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.integrals.build_integrals:3
msgid "Molecular geometry in Angstrom and explicit closed-shell space."
msgstr "以埃为单位的分子几何结构和显式指定的闭壳层空间。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.integrals.build_integrals:4
msgid "Optional nonempty point-charge array in elementary charges."
msgstr "可选的非空点电荷数组，单位为元电荷。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.integrals.build_integrals:5
msgid "Corresponding coordinates in Angstrom."
msgstr "对应坐标，单位为埃。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.integrals.build_integrals:6
msgid "Diagonal or full active-space one-electron perturbation."
msgstr "对角或完整活性空间单电子微扰。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.integrals.build_integrals:7
msgid "Executor's conservative whole-run memory cap in decimal MB."
msgstr "执行器为整次运行设置的保守内存上限，以十进制 MB 计。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.integrals.build_integrals:8
msgid "User's whole-run memory cap in decimal MB."
msgstr "用户为整次运行设置的内存上限，以十进制 MB 计。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.integrals.build_integrals:9
msgid "Override only the standard soft resource rejection boundary."
msgstr "仅覆盖标准的资源软拒绝边界。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.integrals.build_integrals:11
msgid "Read-only integrals/MOs and same-frame HF expectation with provenance."
msgstr "只读积分/MO，以及同一参考系中包含来源记录的 HF 期望值。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.integrals.build_integrals:13
msgid "Malformed inputs, missing helper frame, or invalid integrals."
msgstr "输入格式错误、缺少辅助参考系或积分无效。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.integrals.build_integrals:14
msgid "RHF did not converge."
msgstr "RHF 未收敛。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.integrals.build_integrals:15
msgid "The pre-allocation estimate reaches the run cap."
msgstr "分配前估计值达到运行上限。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.integrals.build_integrals:16
msgid "Real-AO work is outside the bounded inventory."
msgstr "实数 AO 工作超出有界资源清单的范围。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.integrals.build_integrals:18
msgid ""
"An external process-tree RSS monitor and wall timeout are required. Molecular basis metadata is "
"built first to count AOs. The inventory guard then runs before any RHF or integral "
"transformation. Its estimate is recorded in source and does not certify the later "
"sampling/reference stages or arbitrary hosts."
msgstr ""
"必须使用外部进程树 RSS 监控器和墙钟超时。首先构建分子基组元数据以统计 AO 数。随后在任何 RHF 或积分变换之前运行资源清单保护检查。其估计值记录在 source "
"中，不能据此确认后续采样/参考阶段或任意主机的资源安全性。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.integrals.hamiltonian_id:1
msgid "Hash actual integrals using the ``q2m3.hamiltonian.v1`` byte format."
msgstr "使用 ``q2m3.hamiltonian.v1`` 字节格式对实际积分计算哈希。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.integrals.hamiltonian_id:3
msgid ""
"The digest starts with the version and NUL, then compact ASCII JSON ``[norb,[nalpha,nbeta]]`` and"
" NUL. Each h1, h2, e_core field has a compact ``[name,shape,\"<f8\"]`` JSON header and NUL, "
"followed by little-endian float64 C-order bytes. e_core is a scalar with shape []. No labels "
"enter the digest."
msgstr ""
"摘要输入依次以版本号和 NUL、紧凑 ASCII JSON ``[norb,[nalpha,nbeta]]`` 和 NUL 开头。h1、h2、e_core 各字段均含紧凑的 "
"``[name,shape,\"<f8\"]`` JSON 头和 NUL，随后是小端 float64 的 C 顺序字节。e_core 是形状为 [] 的标量。标签均不参与摘要计算。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.integrals.hamiltonian_id:8
msgid "Real one-electron matrix in Hartree."
msgstr "实数单电子矩阵，单位为 Hartree。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.integrals.hamiltonian_id:9
msgid "Real chemist two-electron tensor in Hartree."
msgstr "化学家记号的实数双电子张量，单位为 Hartree。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.integrals.hamiltonian_id:10
msgid "Core plus nuclear constant in Hartree."
msgstr "核心加核常数，单位为 Hartree。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.ansatz.build_ccsd_seed_from_integrals:11 q2m3.sqd.integrals.hamiltonian_id:12
msgid "Balanced spin populations."
msgstr "平衡的自旋电子数。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.integrals.hamiltonian_id:14
msgid "Lowercase SHA256 hex digest, invariant to storage order and endianness."
msgstr "小写 SHA256 十六进制摘要，不受存储顺序和字节序影响。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.integrals.hamiltonian_id:16
msgid "Shape, spin populations, or real/finite representation is invalid."
msgstr "形状、自旋电子数或实数/有限值表示无效。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.ansatz.build_ccsd_seed:1
msgid "Solve RCCSD in the supplied fixed frame without rerunning SCF."
msgstr "在所提供的固定参考系中求解 RCCSD，不重新运行 SCF。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.ansatz.build_ccsd_seed:3
msgid "Immutable Hamiltonian and complete molecular-frame source."
msgstr "不可变哈密顿量和完整的分子参考系来源记录。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.ansatz.build_ccsd_seed:4 q2m3.sqd.ansatz.build_ccsd_seed_from_integrals:13
msgid "Executor whole-run cap in decimal MB."
msgstr "执行器为整次运行设置的上限，以十进制 MB 计。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.ansatz.build_ccsd_seed:5 q2m3.sqd.ansatz.build_ccsd_seed_from_integrals:14
msgid "User whole-run cap in decimal MB."
msgstr "用户为整次运行设置的上限，以十进制 MB 计。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.ansatz.build_ccsd_seed:6 q2m3.sqd.ansatz.build_ccsd_seed_from_integrals:15
msgid "Override only the resource soft boundary."
msgstr "仅覆盖资源软边界。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.ansatz.build_ccsd_seed:7 q2m3.sqd.ansatz.build_ccsd_seed_from_integrals:16
msgid "Iteration bound, 0..200. Zero exercises convergence refusal."
msgstr "迭代次数上限，范围为 0..200。设为零时检验不收敛拒绝路径。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.ansatz.build_ccsd_seed:9
msgid "Converged read-only amplitudes with independently verified Ha residual."
msgstr "已收敛的只读振幅，包含经独立验证、以 Ha 为单位的残差。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.ansatz.build_ccsd_seed:11 q2m3.sqd.ansatz.build_ccsd_seed_from_integrals:20
msgid "Iterations fail or the physical residual is unacceptable."
msgstr "迭代失败或物理残差不可接受。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.ansatz.build_ccsd_seed:12
msgid "Supplied Hamiltonian/frame/energy is inconsistent."
msgstr "所提供的哈密顿量/参考系/能量不一致。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.ansatz.build_ccsd_seed:13 q2m3.sqd.ansatz.build_ccsd_seed_from_integrals:22
msgid "Inventory guard refuses allocation."
msgstr "资源清单保护检查拒绝分配内存。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.ansatz.build_ccsd_seed_from_integrals:1
msgid "Solve fixed-frame RCCSD from the low-level integral contract."
msgstr "按底层积分契约，在固定轨道框架中求解 RCCSD。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.ansatz.build_ccsd_seed_from_integrals:3
msgid ""
"Only the Hamiltonian hash of ``context`` is recomputed from the arrays. The frame digest is not "
"reconstructed, so the caller is responsible for the ``frame_id`` binding between ``context`` and "
"the integrals."
msgstr "只根据数组重算 ``context`` 的哈密顿量哈希。框架摘要不重建，所以 ``context`` 与积分之间的 ``frame_id`` 绑定由调用方负责。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.ansatz.build_ccsd_seed_from_integrals:7
msgid "Real one-electron integrals in the declared frame."
msgstr "声明框架中的实数单电子积分。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.ansatz.build_ccsd_seed_from_integrals:8
msgid "Real chemist two-electron tensor in the declared frame."
msgstr "声明框架中的实数化学家记号双电子张量。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.ansatz.build_ccsd_seed_from_integrals:9
msgid "Same-Hamiltonian core constant in Hartree."
msgstr "同一哈密顿量的核心常数，单位为 Hartree。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.ansatz.build_ccsd_seed_from_integrals:12
msgid "Frame and Hamiltonian provenance. The source may be empty."
msgstr "框架与哈密顿量的来源记录。source 可以为空。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.ansatz.build_ccsd_seed_from_integrals:18
msgid "Converged read-only amplitudes carrying the context identifiers."
msgstr "已收敛的只读振幅，带有 context 的标识。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.ansatz.build_ccsd_seed_from_integrals:21
msgid "Integrals disagree with the context Hamiltonian hash."
msgstr "积分与 context 的哈密顿量哈希不一致。"

#: ../../source/api-reference/sqd.rst:73
msgid "Result Transport"
msgstr "结果传输"

#: ../../source/api-reference/sqd.rst:75
msgid ""
"These functions encode frozen SQD records as tagged tuples that pickle without custom reducers, "
"and rebuild them in another process."
msgstr "这两个函数把冻结的 SQD 记录编码为带标签的元组。这些元组不需要自定义 reducer 就能 pickle。函数还能在另一个进程中重建记录。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.transport.encode_result:1
msgid "Encode a value as nested tagged tuples that pickle without custom reducers."
msgstr "把值编码为嵌套的带标签元组。这些元组不需要自定义 reducer 就能 pickle。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.transport.encode_result:3
msgid ""
"Dataclass records become ``(\"record\", module, name, fields)``. Mappings, including read-only "
"snapshots, become plain dictionaries, so the record constructor must freeze them again on decode."
msgstr "数据类记录变为 ``(\"record\", module, name, fields)``。映射（含只读快照）变为普通字典，所以解码时记录的构造函数必须再次冻结它们。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.transport.encode_result:7
msgid "A dataclass record, mapping, tuple, list or plain value."
msgstr "数据类记录、映射、元组、列表或普通值。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.transport.encode_result:9
msgid "The tagged encoding of ``value``."
msgstr "``value`` 的带标签编码。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.transport.decode_result:1
msgid "Rebuild a value encoded by :func:`encode_result`."
msgstr "重建由 :func:`encode_result` 编码的值。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.transport.decode_result:3
msgid ""
"Records are rebuilt through their constructors, so their validation runs again. Only record types"
" defined under ``q2m3.sqd.`` are rebuilt. This limits which types can be constructed; it does not"
" make untrusted payloads safe. Callers must only unpickle payloads that the parent process wrote "
"to its own private directory or pipe."
msgstr ""
"记录经其构造函数重建，所以校验会再次运行。只重建定义在 ``q2m3.sqd.`` "
"下的记录类型。这一限制约束可构造的类型，但不能使不可信的载荷变得安全。调用方只能反序列化父进程写入其私有目录或管道的载荷。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.transport.decode_result:9
msgid "``SQDConfig`` cannot be decoded: its ``molecule`` field is a ``q2m3.molecule.MoleculeConfig``."
msgstr "``SQDConfig`` 不能解码：它的 ``molecule`` 字段是 ``q2m3.molecule.MoleculeConfig``。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.transport.decode_result:12
msgid "The tagged encoding."
msgstr "带标签的编码。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.transport.decode_result:13
msgid "Flag checked before each node is rebuilt."
msgstr "重建每个节点之前检查的标志。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.transport.decode_result:15
msgid "The rebuilt value."
msgstr "重建后的值。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.transport.decode_result:17
msgid "If ``cancelled`` is set during reconstruction."
msgstr "重建期间 ``cancelled`` 被置位。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.transport.decode_result:18
msgid "If a record type is defined outside ``q2m3.sqd.``."
msgstr "记录类型定义在 ``q2m3.sqd.`` 之外。"

#: ../../source/api-reference/sqd.rst:83
msgid "Resource Policy"
msgstr "资源策略"

#: of q2m3.sqd.resources.estimate_rss_mb:1
msgid "Estimate total simultaneously resident memory for one serial stage."
msgstr "估计单个串行阶段同时驻留的总内存。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.resources.estimate_rss_mb:3 q2m3.sqd.resources.guard_allocation:3
msgid "Active spatial orbitals."
msgstr "活性空间轨道。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.resources.estimate_rss_mb:4 q2m3.sqd.resources.guard_allocation:4
msgid "Balanced alpha/beta populations."
msgstr "平衡的 alpha/beta 电子数。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.resources.estimate_rss_mb:5
msgid "Operation about to allocate memory."
msgstr "即将分配内存的操作。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.resources.estimate_rss_mb:6
msgid "Candidate spin-sector sizes, required for fixed spaces."
msgstr "候选自旋扇区大小；固定空间必须提供。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.resources.estimate_rss_mb:7
msgid "Additional live inputs outside the model's workload inventory."
msgstr "模型工作负载资源清单之外仍在使用的额外输入。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.resources.estimate_rss_mb:8
msgid "Required reference solver identity."
msgstr "所需参考求解器的标识。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.resources.estimate_rss_mb:9
msgid "Versioned model already checked against its runtime environment."
msgstr "已根据运行环境检查的带版本模型。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.resources.estimate_rss_mb:11
msgid "Finite decimal MB, including imports, workspace and retained inputs."
msgstr "以十进制 MB 计的有限值，包括导入、工作区和保留的输入。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.resources.estimate_rss_mb:13
msgid "Malformed counts or retained memory."
msgstr "数量或保留内存的格式错误。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.resources.estimate_rss_mb:14
msgid "Missing dimensions, unsupported stage or invalid bound."
msgstr "缺少维度、不支持该阶段或边界无效。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.resources.guard_allocation:1
msgid "Reject an unsafe operation before allocating its working space."
msgstr "在分配工作空间之前拒绝不安全的操作。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.resources.guard_allocation:5
msgid "Stage about to run."
msgstr "即将运行的阶段。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.resources.guard_allocation:6
msgid "Applicable empirical model."
msgstr "适用的经验模型。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.resources.guard_allocation:7
msgid "Conservative total run cap supplied by the executor."
msgstr "执行器提供的保守运行总上限。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.resources.guard_allocation:8
msgid "Actual candidates, or a proven pre-call dimension bound."
msgstr "实际候选，或经证明的调用前维度上界。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.resources.guard_allocation:9
msgid "Additional simultaneously live memory outside the inventory."
msgstr "资源清单之外同时在用的额外内存。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.resources.guard_allocation:10
msgid "Reference solver identity, when applicable."
msgstr "参考求解器标识（如适用）。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.resources.guard_allocation:11
msgid "Optional user cap. An override never bypasses this cap."
msgstr "可选的用户上限。覆盖设置绝不会绕过此上限。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.resources.guard_allocation:12
msgid "Permit estimates above the default soft rejection boundary."
msgstr "允许估计值超过默认软拒绝边界。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.resources.guard_allocation:14
msgid "The checked estimate in decimal MB."
msgstr "检查后的估计值，以十进制 MB 计。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.resources.guard_allocation:16
msgid "Estimate reaches any applicable rejection boundary."
msgstr "估计值达到任一适用的拒绝边界。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.resources.guard_allocation:17
msgid "No applicable bound exists, even with override."
msgstr "不存在适用的上界，即使启用覆盖设置也不例外。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.resources.load_resource_model:1
msgid "Load a validated model and reject incompatible dependencies or workload."
msgstr "加载已验证的模型，并拒绝不兼容的依赖项或工作负载。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.resources.load_resource_model:3
msgid "Calibration artifact. Defaults to the shipped coefficient file."
msgstr "校准产物。默认为随包提供的系数文件。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.resources.load_resource_model:4
msgid ""
"Exact explicit manifest, or installed distribution versions. Only absent optional Catalyst is "
"accepted when inspecting the installation. An installed Catalyst version must still match the "
"calibration."
msgstr "完整且明确的清单，或已安装分发包的版本。检查安装时，仅允许可选的 Catalyst 缺失。若已安装 Catalyst，其版本仍必须与校准记录匹配。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.resources.load_resource_model:7
msgid "Workload overrides to check against the artifact's bounded profile."
msgstr "需要根据校准产物的有界配置检查的工作负载覆盖设置。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.resources.load_resource_model:9
msgid ""
"An immutable model. Executors must honor the recorded live-array schedule, solver settings and "
"profile. Arbitrary geometry/AO-basis work is not covered."
msgstr "不可变模型。执行器必须遵守记录的在用数组调度、求解器设置和配置。不涵盖任意几何结构/AO 基组工作。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.resources.load_resource_model:12
msgid "Missing artifact, unvalidated model or runtime mismatch."
msgstr "产物缺失、模型未经验证或运行环境不匹配。"

#: ../../source/api-reference/sqd.rst:92
msgid "Exceptions"
msgstr "异常"

#: of q2m3.sqd.exceptions:1
msgid "Typed SQD failures shared by optional numerical backends."
msgstr "可选数值后端共用的带类型 SQD 失败。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.exceptions.ResourceLimitError:1
msgid "A run exceeds its allowed resource budget."
msgstr "运行超出允许的资源预算。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.exceptions.ResourceModelDomainError:1
msgid "No calibrated resource bound applies to the requested operation."
msgstr "没有适用于所请求操作的已校准资源上界。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.exceptions.CCSDConvergenceError:1
msgid "The ansatz seed did not converge."
msgstr "拟设初始解未收敛。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.exceptions.BaselineUnavailableError:1
msgid "No permitted reference solver can supply a baseline."
msgstr "没有获准使用的参考求解器能提供基线。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.exceptions.ReferenceUnavailableError:1
msgid "An optional reference solver is unavailable."
msgstr "可选的参考求解器不可用。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.exceptions.ReferenceTimeoutError:1
msgid "A reference solve exhausted its time budget."
msgstr "参考求解耗尽时间预算。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.exceptions.ReferenceNumericalError:1
msgid "A reference solve failed its numerical acceptance checks."
msgstr "参考求解未通过数值验收检查。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.exceptions.SamplingIntegrityError:1
msgid "Samples violate the sampling contract."
msgstr "样本违反采样契约。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.exceptions.ComparisonUnavailableError:1
msgid "A required matched comparison cannot be produced."
msgstr "无法生成所需的匹配比较。"

#: of q2m3.sqd.exceptions.ProvenanceMismatchError:1
msgid "Inputs refer to different orbital frames or Hamiltonians."
msgstr "输入对应不同的轨道参考系或哈密顿量。"
